      <h1>Suspension: Frequency Response Controller Design</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/tf.html"><tt>tf</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/techdoc/ref/conv.html"><tt>conv</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/ident/ref/bode.html"><tt>bode</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/margin.html"><tt>margin</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/feedback.html"><tt>feedback</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/step.html"><tt>step</tt></a></p>
            </div>
